EntMod_MM.dll -- EntMod ("Ent Mod v4"), reconstructed from the shipped DLL, with HAVOC9 changes
================================================================================================

What this is
------------

EntMod_MM.dll is built from a clean, recompilable C++ reconstruction of the abandoned EntMod
("Ent Mod v4", Drunken_F00l / remortal, adminop.net), which shipped only as a binary with no source.
It was reverse-engineered from the shipped EntMod_MM.dll / EntMod_i386.so into EntMod4/src/EntMod4/
(the faithful original) and EntMod4/src/h9/ (the HAVOC9 additions). It is a Metamod-R plugin for The
Specialists on the H9XASH engine. This file is the Windows build; EntMod_i386.so is the Linux build of
the same source.

Deployed file : addons/EntMod/dlls/EntMod_MM.dll
Built by      : EntMod4/src/build-windows.ps1 (MSBuild, Win32, Release, PlatformToolset v143)
                -> EntMod4/dist/EntMod_MM.dll, deployed to H9XASH/ts/addons/EntMod/dlls and
                EntMod4/win/addons/EntMod/dlls.
